{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_10_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a550e4a501c349bff378e41953e5c77023cfee0e63e34748c45fd70ae1cd0f25",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea7981daf14509f8a21abdf9c1a1630f1ef6b98838327916825c25c8fe70150a",
      "text": "我们就是“男极〇〇〇〇”！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:688c863294709830df3b538d03ce7cdf284a8be06e7f27ac4c84dcec368adae7",
      "text": "5人决定出演前男极联赛主办方举办的\n大型LIVE。预想到了对方会进行妨碍，\n各自采取的“对策”是……随后，\nLIVE当天，决战时刻终于到来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000027:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bde9ae20a545cf305d5f25c2458465af716321b2fb89ec28902eb9a21ab4d67f",
      "text": "第10话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000027:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea7981daf14509f8a21abdf9c1a1630f1ef6b98838327916825c25c8fe70150a",
      "text": "我们就是“男极〇〇〇〇”！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:411257f456d8bfd025cb5c3800804cd762bba54e1338a33d77765b9c23627308",
      "text": "现在开始，为了迎战前男极主办方举办的\n大型LIVE，召开研讨会议。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2f7c6f8e9ad71c38a338c491c4c4029bb8cc2f3ce6ddfdac0fa93236cf7201b",
      "text": "希望各位畅所欲言。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:445c377854f0ed80c661ddf7569f43e4273a3ba7315304249574b0b5267e9282",
      "text": "今天的练习虽然挺顺利，\n但问题是当天对方会怎么出招，对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a53240000b9f1a6c4563122a5db4c3d4792a8a887838a8ecb9fa584c90a424a7",
      "text": "毕竟那男人向来都会对\n自己看不顺眼的对手百般阻挠啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce114f38dea6e9bd71ae889da8ad0e3574f82dc03b3071fa6823d0f0ef4d30e0",
      "text": "这次也不知道会发生什么。必须预想会受到\n各种各样的妨碍，提前制定好对策才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef2b1e2246d84ad286862fa2423f4363099120b2dfda6dd3bc767eafd61e194a",
      "text": "……先由我来说可以吗？\n关于当天的出行，我有一个提议！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000112:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbd8cd8f012082d6b23d14a456be8208fe6e19d6f626e6aa07703d992a956fb9",
      "text": "（今天的训练也顺利结束了。趁现在，\n先检查一下训练服和演出服装吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:646f1b991276553482d6df4b3668484e549173691fd260961bffd0baa9ffd3ef",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d9ca969b5c6d00edc3f1d71f5f0c3430bbe1d6db50558a7878429539b6e8bc1",
      "text": "嗯？那是……\n全都有破损或者开线了啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:226addf9b74c7f806b1ef8da5a787a3a9d63a31e9e978c15113bedebfff5434a",
      "text": "这正是大家在训练中竭尽全力的证明！\n在LIVE之前会修补好的，请放心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000160:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef2b1e2246d84ad286862fa2423f4363099120b2dfda6dd3bc767eafd61e194a",
      "text": "……先由我来说可以吗？\n关于当天的出行，我有一个提议！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000180:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8807641d846c0452876fc3ab7d6cccfd859966d797bb9992ed496a8754de80b5",
      "text": "（……没错。我也一定还有\n能够帮到大家的地方！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000191:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6af28ff5b8dcb2940d97f144efab4f28463fa4bddc01ecb0b59fb789b880b78e",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー！\n修补服装的事，能不能交给我？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000198:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c82e887cb37ead7c478e2aa1a99990f77e68830d38024e8c5864c39c1d6432e",
      "text": "还有……不只是修补，\n稍微改动一下可以吗？比如说……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
